@startuml
title 锁机制架构 - 整体架构

package "并发层" {
  [Session 1] as S1
  [Session 2] as S2
  [Session 3] as S3
  [Session 4] as S4
}

package "调度层" {
  [TaskManager\nscheduleNext] as TM
}

package "锁层" {
  [async-lock\n全局互斥锁] as AL
}

package "执行层" {
  [maven-test\n串行执行] as MT
}

S1 -down-> TM : 并发思考
S2 -down-> TM : 并发思考
S3 -down-> TM : 并发思考
S4 -down-> TM : 并发思考

TM -down-> AL : 调用
AL -down-> MT : 串行执行

note right of AL
  全局互斥锁
  保证 mvn test 串行
end note

note bottom of MT
  在原项目目录执行
  共享 .m2 缓存
end note

@enduml